# RibAssist 3D public repo policy
#
# TRACK (intended for release):
#   scripts/ (full retrain + sealed eval; see exclusions below)
#   LICENSE, LICENSE-DOCS, MODEL_TERMS.md, DISCLAIMER.md, README.md, NOTICE
#   requirements.txt, requirements-demo.txt, pyproject.toml
#   app.py, demo_app/ (Streamlit clinician-review demo; checkpoints local-only)
#   figures/ (paper SVGs, main_results.png, ribassist_demo.gif)
#   frozen_split.json, split_manifest.json
#   outputs/sealed/*.json (headline sealed-eval results)
#
# IGNORE: licensed data, derived labels, checkpoints, generated outputs,
# internal docs/decks, local env, scratch artifacts, huggingface/ (Hub-only),
# scripts/huggingface_publish/ (maintainer upload helpers), and paper/ (until arXiv).

# --- Local / tooling ---
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
.cursor/
*.code-workspace
*.log
*.tmp
scratch/
tmp/
local/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
.conda/
pip-wheel-metadata/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Streamlit
.streamlit/*
!.streamlit/config.toml

# Node (scripts/generate_deck.js)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# ML experiment logs
wandb/
mlruns/

# --- Licensed clinical data (never commit) ---
data/

# --- Derived labels and tables (from RibFrac/RibSeg; regenerate locally) ---
*.csv
/labels_val.csv
/labels*.csv
/address_dataset.npz

# --- Large binaries, checkpoints, and tensors ---
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.npz
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
/ribseg_v2.zip

# --- Root JSON: only split manifests are public ---
/*.json
!/frozen_split.json
!/geometry_split.json
!/split_manifest.json

# --- Generated HTML (ignore all) ---
*.html

# --- Generated images (allowlist paper figures only) ---
*.png
*.gif
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
!figures/
figures/*
!figures/fig_*.svg
!figures/main_results.png
!figures/ribassist_demo.gif

# --- Public documentation (ignore other markdown by default) ---
*.md
!README.md
!MODEL_TERMS.md
!DISCLAIMER.md
!DATA_SETUP.md
!REPRODUCE.md

# --- Hugging Face Hub publish bundle (local staging only; never commit to GitHub) ---
# Prepare locally, then upload the folder contents to kabilasoboka/RibAssist-3D on the Hub.
# The Hub repo is a separate git repository — commit everything in this folder there.
huggingface/

# --- Maintainer Hub upload helpers (local only; not on GitHub or Hugging Face) ---
scripts/huggingface_publish/
/PROJECT_PLAN.md
/RibAssist_report.md
/RibAssist_findings_A_to_D2.md

# --- Internal deliverables ---
*.pptx
/RibAssist_deck.pptx
deck_assets/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv

# --- paper/ (local only until arXiv publication) ---
paper/

# --- Legacy / internal scripts (local only; not part of public release) ---
# Pre-main-arc feasibility probes
scripts/ribfrac_feasibility_audit.py
scripts/build_probe.py
scripts/make_drr.py
# Superseded summary / pattern / atlas-geometry evaluators
scripts/build_summary.py
scripts/eval_pattern.py
scripts/eval_geometry.py
# One-off dev utilities and internal deck tooling
scripts/reeval_detector.py
scripts/overlay_predictions.py
scripts/capture_demo_screenshots.py
scripts/generate_deck.js

# --- Maintainer-only demo tooling (not part of public release) ---
scripts/make_readme_demo_gif.py
scripts/export_review_site.py
scripts/ribassist_review_template.html

# --- Generated outputs (ignore all; un-ignore sealed headline JSONs) ---
outputs/*
!outputs/sealed/
outputs/sealed/*
!outputs/sealed/*.json
